{% if "portable" in pieces %}{% else %}| D-009 | 2026-10-27 | all          | Mobile-first owner: every request starts with one checklist of all human-only steps, each marked phone or computer with how agents verify it, computer steps first; then agents run to the end without waiting on a human except batched chat approvals ("approve A B C") and release-environment taps; an undeclared human step found later is added as a prerequisite while agents work on. bosun implements it as `bosun prereqs` (in progress). [why](decisions/009-mobile-first-owner.md)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
